cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, developed within the FutuRSI project, please cite
  it and the underlying survey dataset using the metadata in this file.
title: Germany-Focused International RSE Survey Publication — FutuRSI
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Dhia
    family-names: Haddad
    affiliation: Helmholtz-Zentrum Dresden-Rossendorf (HZDR)
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6816-3672'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/dhiahaddad/rse-survey-2026'
url: 'https://dhiahaddad.github.io/rse-survey-2026/'
abstract: >-
  A dynamically generated, Germany-focused publication of International RSE
  Survey results for 2017, 2018, 2022, and 2026, developed within the federated
  FutuRSI project. The software is designed so that maintainers can readily
  generate equivalent publications for another country or a selected group of
  countries.
keywords:
  - Research Software Engineering
  - RSE
  - Germany
  - International RSE Survey
  - FutuRSI
  - survey analysis
